      "evidence": "internal/goal/branch/rebase_conflict.go: after the before/after and HEAD checks, `git add -A -- sourcesToResolve` runs. The later `diff --diff-filter=U` check cannot see markers in a staged file. TestRebaseResolveRound asserts NeedsReview == [u1] for resolved units.",
